  "title": "Teradata Elects Todd McElhatton to Board of Directors",
  "summary": "Teradata today announced the election of Todd McElhatton to its Board of Directors, effective June 1, 2022. With his election, Teradata expanded the size of the Board from 9 to 10 directors, nine of whom are independent.",
